# SaveLoom UI

- Import design tokens from `~/lib/design` — avoid ad-hoc `shadow-xl`, `rounded-3xl`, gradient icon boxes
- Icon badges: ghost tints (`iconBadge.sm`, `iconBadgeTint('emerald'|'red'|...)`)
- Lists: `listRow.item` + `surfaces.list` + `compact-scroll` for dense transaction/account rows
- Merchant/category icons: `MerchantIcon`, `CategoryIcon` — not raw emoji
- Page width: `page-container` / `layout.page` (max 2000px)
- Glass surfaces: `glass-card`, `hero-card-purple` in globals.css
- Shared shell: `PageShell`, `AppNav`, `EmptyState`
